{"id":"vod_sn_39072","vodId":"39072","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"日常系的异能战斗","name_cn":"日常系的异能战斗","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d44f7fad7b22e6aa6af24834f14406d9.jpg"},"summary":"泉光高中文艺部生活着一群性格各异的青春男女，其中高中二年级的安藤寿来（冈本信彦 配音）是一个典型的中二病，他每天梦想拥有超能力来拯救世界，谁想到不切实际的愿望竟然真的实现了。在毫无征兆的日子里，安藤掌握了“黑焰”的能力，其他成员也各有所长，如操纵时间的隐藏宅女神崎灯代（ 山崎遥 配音）、掌握自然属性的天然少女栉川鸠子（早见沙织 配音）、可把一切事物还原的腐女部长高梨彩弓（种田梨沙 配音）、可自由创造物质和空间的文艺部顾问老师的侄女姬木千冬（山下七海 配音）。可是现实世界没有邪恶敌人对付怎么办？那就只好自娱自乐喽……　　本片根据望公太的轻小说改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/JZCLCFtwFv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/kQ9xfehqHD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1wL5XCjFSB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EFxxr6TrL81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/c3g5LBV4ZG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/s86wYnSR521/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/VQWe73i7Gs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/E6SaLE2J991/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/g7MermaV6J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/n1GEg8aPyT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/XfdVsUQyXL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ZbPhSxyNYi1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:50.867Z"}